    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FOLK HORROR COMEDY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's Weird Here</i> presents a tongue-in-cheek take on the folk horror genre, replete with blood, oddballs, and, of course, exposed flesh... Will YOU survive the weirdness?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CLASSIC SURVIVAL HORROR GAMEPLAY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carve a path through the lunatics who seek your demise; navigate a labyrinthine landscape; solve puzzles; and, last but not least...manage your inventory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RETRO-INSPIRED AESTHETICS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gaudy border illustrations complement a minimalist, retro-inspired play space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
