        "notes": "'It's Weird Here' is a game in the 'Folk Horror' genre; as such, it contains frequent depictions of ritualistic gore and (occasional) depictions of ritualistic sex. It is important to understand that this is NOT primarily a sex-themed game; instead, it is a horror game with occasional depictions of sexual acts. More info:\r\n\r\nFrequent depictions of violence, gore and torture. \r\nOccasional hard drug use. \r\nFrequent depictions of nudity and genitalia.\r\nOccasional depictions of uncensored sex and sexual acts between consenting adults. \r\nOccasional depictions of ritualistic suicide and ritualistic self-harm.\r\nStrong language."
